  "description": "A .NET library for US mortgage calculations and educational borrower screening. Provides DTI ratio calculation (front-end and back-end), LTV ratio, mortgage insurance type detection, monthly payment estimation, and simplified borrower screening across Conventional, FHA, and VA loan types. Built by OurNetHelps.com - mortgage technology tools for US mortgage brokers. Educational use only; does not determine approval or eligibility.",
